\ A helper whose declared effect types its input. The interpreter checks that type when the helper
\ is called, and an AOT quotation loses its annotations when it is serialized, so no compiled read
\ can run the same check. The build refuses the word.

typed-helper: ( n: fixnum -- n ) [
  inc: ( n: fixnum -- n ) [ 1 + ] ;
  inc
] ;

4 typed-helper .
